// ---------- coming back ----------
// The night's summary is gated on having projects, so somebody who passed the torch and
// then quit came back to a completely silent screen — and that is exactly the player worth
// greeting. This note fires on its own, whether or not anything was earned overnight.
// One line for coming back, picked by how many days you have shown up. The cast that used
