  // THE FRAME'S OWN CHROMA, WAVE 19. The top fifth measures C* 15.5 against the board's 18.7
  // and it is the widest single gap left in the picture — `quinto.js` attributes 40% of that
  // fifth to seven entries and they are all proscenium: `muroM/muroC/muroK/muroL` and
  // `colunaC/colunaL/colunaB`. Wave 14 took their mass in VALUE, which is why they are there
