      // widest chroma gap left (17.0 against 20.4). It landed in the WRONG FIFTH: the third
      // went 17.0 -> 17.9 and the FOURTH went 21.9 -> 23.6, and the fourth was already 4.2
      // over a board that reads 17.7 there, because the board's fourth fifth is a shaded
